WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:29.550
Yugi, I applaud you for summoning your God first when I was in total control of this game.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:35.310
But since Lightforce Sword's effect ended, I summoned my God, Obelisk!

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:39.110
Your Slifer and my Obelisk!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:42.450
It's finally time for our Gods to clash!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:49.020
Clash!  Slifer vs Obelisk

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.500
Look, Yugi!

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.540
This is my deck's God!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:11.040
Obelisk the Tormentor has finally appeared.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:22.880
Wow!  My brother and Yugi have already summoned their Gods!

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:38.040
Those are the legendary God Cards!

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:42.220
Slifer the Sky Dragon and Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:51.120
I could search all the oceans and never find anything as strong!

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.300
Honda!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.060
We finally made contact!

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.260
A helicopter is on the way!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.000
Honda, thank you!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.700
Jonouchi, just a little longer.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.410
Hey everyone...

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.340
Look.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.140
That's...

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:28.700
Obelisk and Slifer's fight has finally started!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.330
Yugi...

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:45.500
Who will destroy his opponent's God?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:50.110
Yugi, my Obelisk will annihilate your Slifer!

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.880
You have two cards in your hand.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:58.620
The number of cards in your hand determines Slifer's attack points.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:02.730
Therefore, Slifer has 2000 attack points.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:10.130
But don't forget Slifer's effect, Kaiba.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:15.660
It activated when you summoned Obelisk!

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.700
Go!  Slifer's effect!

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.340
Lightning Bullet!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:40.190
Slifer's lightning shaves 2000 attack points off my summoned monster.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.710
Good.  Obelisk is down to 2000 attack points.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:59.920
Our Gods' attack points are equal this turn.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.090
If I attack, they'll both be destroyed.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:07.220
Yugi kept Slifer's effect in mind when he reduced his hand to two cards.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:12.510
But spell and monster effects only last for one turn against a God.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:17.230
Obelisk will have 4000 attack points again next turn.

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:22.230
Even if I draw a card, Slifer will only have 3000 attack points.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.230
I'll fight him next turn!

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:30.340
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.680
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:37.680
Slifer's attack points rise to 3000!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.590
But Obelisk's attack points return to 4000.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.560
I'm not done, Kaiba!

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.700
I activate my spell card!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.200
Pot of Greed!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:59.340
Pot of Greed allows me to draw two cards from my deck.

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:06.010
Slifer's attack points power up!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:10.010
Now Slifer has 5000 attack points.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:13.080
Which is more than Obelisk's!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.940
Go, Slifer!  Thunder-

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.140
Not good enough, Yugi!

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.190
I activate my spell card!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.480
Command Silencer!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:35.970
Slifer can't attack if it can't hear your orders.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:41.980
Command Silencer cancels your attack orders and ends the Battle Phase.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:51.220
And Command Silencer's effect lets me draw a card.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:54.960
So you won't let me attack so easily.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:01.230
What if that set card is Life Shaver?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:07.540
Life Shaver reduces my hand equal to the number of turns that it's set.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.740
Kaiba will definitely use it next turn.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:16.750
When he does, Slifer will have 4000 attack points, which is equal to Obelisk's.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:21.980
If I reduce my hand, he'll destroy Slifer when its attack points decrease.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:23.230
But...

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:27.230
I set two cards!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.960
I end my turn!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:36.970
He set his cards even though Slifer would lose attack points?

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.470
I'll end this next turn, Kaiba!

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.310
Which God is going to win?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.810
My turn!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.120
Kaiba!  Here I go!

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.970
I activate my spell card!

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.860
Card Destruction!

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:58.780
We both discard our hands.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.330
Then we draw the same amount from our decks.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.560
He's replacing his hand.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:14.200
Even though he replaced his hand, Slifer's attack points remain at 3000.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.860
Then I activate the trap card, Disgraceful Charity!

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:34.320
If a spell sent our cards to the graveyard, we both can return them to our hands this turn.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.810
A combo to strengthen his hand!

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:44.060
I now have six cards in my hand.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:48.120
Slifer powers up to 6000 attack points!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.760
Well done, Yugi...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:09:01.400
...is what I'd say, but I knew you'd have many cards in your deck that would strengthen your hand.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.690
Your combo just gave me the win.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:05.690
What?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.060
I activate a Quick-Play Spell from my hand!

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.940
Thirst for Compensation!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.080
I summon two monsters from my hand.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.710
Come out!

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.180
Sword of Soul!

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.300
Blade Knight!

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.660
That won't help, Kaiba.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:33.520
No matter how many weak monsters you summon, Slifer's effect will destroy them.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.840
Go!  Lightning Bullet!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.280
I knew you'd do that!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.280
The Quick-Play Spell, Card Guard!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.050
What?

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:51.600
By discarding one card from my hand...

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.260
...it protects my monster from damage!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.140
Lightning Bullet failed!

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:16.960
Yugi!  Even if Slifer has 6000 attack points, it's still powerless against Obelisk!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.470
What?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:22.500
Did you forget Obelisk's effect?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.820
Obelisk's effect!

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:38.850
By tributing two monsters, it deals 4000 points of damage to you and your monsters!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.940
Even though I can't destroy Slifer...

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:51.090
Yugi!  This direct damage erases all your life points!

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.090
Oh no!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.100
It's over.

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:55.600
My brother wins!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:01.300
Yugi!  Perish at the hands of my God!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.940
God Hand Crusher!

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.140
Yugi!  I win!

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:24.330
Perish at the hands of my God!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.430
God Hand Crusher!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.660
What's that explosion?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.000
Damn!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.520
Who's winning?  Kaiba or Yugi?

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.350
Yugi...

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.270
Yugi!  How?

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.210
What's wrong, Kaiba?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.150
I'm still alive.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:19.780
I activated Kuriboh's effect from my hand during the battle.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.020
Kuriboh, you saved me.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.210
How dare you, Yugi!

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:30.860
You avoided my God's attack with that puny monster?

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:40.470
I set a card and end my turn.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.930
Now Kaiba has zero cards in his hand.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:47.210
I'll be able to destroy his Obelisk next turn.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:57.300
Slifer powers up to 6000 attack points again!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.270
Slifer!  Attack Obelisk!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.020
Brother!

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.400
Is it really over this time?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:11.130
Go, Slifer!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.940
I was waiting for this moment, Yugi!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:21.050
I activate my trap card!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.600
Power Balance!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.050
What?

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.310
Slifer!  What's going on?

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:39.440
I can activate this trap card when I have zero cards in my hand.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.840
You must choose and discard half your hand.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.700
And I draw the same amount!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:46.970
What?

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:52.970
The effect is already active, so Slifer's attack points are decreasing!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.980
Yugi, you have six cards in your hand.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.880
Discard three cards!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.950
And I draw the same amount from my deck.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:13.560
Slifer's attack points are down to 3000!

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:18.560
The tables have turned, Yugi.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.600
Obelisk!  Strike back at Slifer!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.580
Slow down, Kaiba.

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:28.610
Even if you destroy Slifer, you can't lower my life points to 0.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.850
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.700
Necromancy!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:43.660
Kaiba, I know you want to use Obelisk's effect.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.330
What?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:04.810
Necromancy resurrects four random monsters in your graveyard in defense position.

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:09.820
What?  You really gave me tributes to activate God Hand Crusher?

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:14.820
However, Necromancy has another effect.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:22.060
When a monster that Necromancy summoned is destroyed...

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:26.800
...your remaining monsters lose 600 attack points!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:34.640
Kaiba!  By summoning your monsters, Slifer's effect activates!

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.550
Lightning Bullet!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.620
They're all destroyed!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:50.480
All four Special Summoned monsters are destroyed.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:55.840
So Obelisk loses a total of 2400 attack points!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:16:00.920
How dare you mock my monsters and trap my God!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:09.410
Kaiba!  Slifer has more attack points than Obelisk again!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:10.780
Slifer!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:19.290
What?  Obelisk gained attack points?

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:21.420
You fool.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:32.800
When you destroyed Sword of Soul, its effect raised my monster's attack points by 1000 for one turn.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:38.900
You already ordered Slifer to attack!  You can't take it back!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.340
Strike back, Obelisk!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.550
Perish!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.960
The two Gods repelled each other!

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.240
Too bad, Kaiba.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:04.380
The Battle Phase has ended!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:05.180
What?

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:12.260
Your tactic of raising Obelisk's attack points by sending a monster to the graveyard was impressive.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.970
But I also used the same strategy!

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:21.880
When you used Power Balance at the beginning of this turn...

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:31.200
I discarded Electromagnetic Turtle from my hand.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:37.170
When Electromagnetic Turtle goes to the graveyard, it implants an electrode into a monster.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:40.970
Allowing me to end the battle whenever I want!

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:47.470
You ended the battle right before Obelisk and Slifer clashed!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:52.350
I set a card and end my turn.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.900
What a fierce battle!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:00.250
Whoever lets his guard down will lose!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.990
Go for it, Yugi!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:18.350
I'm getting excited, Yugi!

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:21.150
Our duels have always been exciting.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:25.060
Our clever mental battles were always close.

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:29.240
They always pushed me to my limit!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:41.160
You make adrenaline run through my body and boil my blood!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:52.450
But we don't need two champions on the same path.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.640
I must...

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.560
...defeat you with my own hands!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.280
My turn!

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:07.070
Yugi, you only have one card in your hand.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:10.090
So Slifer has 1000 attack points.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.030
There's nothing you can do.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:16.700
This is truly your end!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.340
Go, Obelisk!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:22.960
You rule atop all Gods!

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.340
This is my final gamble!

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.930
I activate my spell card!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.570
Spell Textbook!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:36.100
By discarding my entire hand, I can draw one card from my deck.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:40.450
If I draw a spell card, I can immediately activate it.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.330
You lowered Slifer's attack points to 0.

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:52.300
Perish, Slifer and Yugi!

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.900
Everything depends on this draw.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.410
Jonouchi...

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.050
I activate my spell card!

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:12.050
What?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.920
Card of Sanctity!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:19.480
We both draw until we have six cards in our hands!

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:29.540
No way!  He drew the most powerful hand-strengthening card?

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.700
Slifer's attack points jump up to 6000!

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:41.850
It's not over!

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:45.020
I activate the trap card, Life Shaver!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:50.020
Oh no!  Slifer loses 2000 attack points!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.390
Hey!  What's that light?

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:23.060
Yugi!

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:47.480
The clash of the two Gods, Slifer and Obelisk.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:51.300
Their unbelievable destructive powers repel each other...

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:54.180
...creating powerful energy on the field.

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:59.420
The energy warps time and space, enveloping Yugi and Kaiba.

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:04.240
Marik's Millennium Rod glows in response.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:07.260
What do the two see beyond time and space?

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.470
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Inherited Duel of Destiny

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.050
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.220 --> 00:22:23.120
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:32.060
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:37.040
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.010
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:48.980
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:52.550
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.320
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:07.430
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:15.040
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:24.010
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:31.990
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:41.830
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
